{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     training/tiers — what it costs. Free first, and that is the argument.
     Ported from NS-Design-System/templates/training-index.html §04.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     ⚠ DUMMY PRICING. Nothing here is wired to Ghost tiers yet.

     FREE IS THE LEFT COLUMN AND IT IS NOT A LAYOUT ACCIDENT — upstream's own
     note: the honest claim is that most of the training is open, and leading
     with the paid column would read as a price list rather than an offer.

     ⚠ WHEN THIS GOES LIVE the figures must come from Ghost's own tiers
     ({{#get "tiers"}}), not from here. Two places that both state a price is
     how a site ends up advertising one number and charging another.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
<section class="ns-band">
    <div class="ns-band__inner">
        <header class="ns-band__head">
            <span class="ns-kicker">{{t "What it costs"}}</span>
            <h2 class="ns-band__title">{{t "Most of it, nothing"}}</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="ns-tiers">
            <div class="ns-tier">
                <span class="ns-tier__label">{{t "Free"}}</span>
                <span class="ns-tier__title">{{t "The training"}}</span>
                <span class="ns-tier__price">{{t "£0 · no account"}}</span>
                <ul class="ns-tier__list">
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "Every published module, in full"}}</span></li>
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "Every code sample and lab file"}}</span></li>
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "Search across everything written"}}</span></li>
                </ul>
                <div class="ns-tier__foot"><a class="ns-btn" href="#modules">{{t "Start reading"}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div class="ns-tier ns-tier--pro">
                <span class="ns-tier__label">{{t "Pro"}}</span>
                <span class="ns-tier__title">{{t "Everything, plus the hard parts"}}</span>
                <span class="ns-tier__price">{{t "Coming later"}}</span>
                <ul class="ns-tier__list">
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "Architecture and AI modules"}}</span></li>
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "Certification practice sets"}}</span></li>
                    <li>{{> "icons/check-circle"}}<span>{{t "A downloadable org for every lab"}}</span></li>
                </ul>
                {{!-- No price and no Buy button, because there is nothing to
                     sell yet. A disabled "Go Pro" would be a control that
                     teaches the reader their click does nothing. --}}
                <div class="ns-tier__foot">
                    {{#if @site.members_enabled}}
                        <a class="ns-btn" href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup">{{t "Tell me when it lands"}}</a>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
